01:15:34,000 --> 01:15:40,000
 And maybe the products are stored as some kind of a noisy database or a knowledge base.

555
01:15:40,000 --> 01:15:46,000
 Right? I say noisy because, you know, product descriptions uploaded by different sellers will have various kinds of noise.

556
01:15:46,000 --> 01:15:50,000
 There will be spelling mistakes, there will be missing attributes, there will be all sorts of things, right?

