01:29:25,000 --> 01:29:42,000
 So there were a Gaussians which were mixed. But what happens if I now make z a real value or a real vector, then how many different Gaussians do I really have?

686
01:29:42,000 --> 01:29:56,000
 I have an infinite number of Gaussians. So the mixture that I'm creating now is not a finite mixture of Gaussians. It's an infinite mixture of Gaussians.

